</div></section><section class="tw xbox font-sm" id="tbl2"><h4 class="obj_head">Table 2.</h4>
<div class="caption p"><p>Marginal and Conditional p Values from the LDL-C GWAS of the <em>APOE</em> Region with 15,626 Individuals from the FINRISK Study</p></div>
